(<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2819510703" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/ros-navigation/navigation2/issues/4884" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/ros-navigation/navigation2/issues/4884/hovercard" href="https://github.com/ros-navigation/navigation2/issues/4884">#4884</a>)

There is no protection/checks in the pathway from lineCost to
costmap_2d::getIndex(mx, my) for grid coordinates that exceed
the of bounds of the allocated costmap. (presumably for speed)

This test was triggering an off by one error attempting to
read the the 2500 byte costmap at byte 2503

costmap size 50x50.

getIndex(3, 50)
= my * size_x_ + mx;
= 50 * 50 + 3;
= 2503

Signed-off-by: Mike Wake &lt;macwake@gmail.com&gt;

